ch hand is filled with strategy and risk. Will you be the first player to play all of your cards? Perhaps you'd like to make a little wager on that? Are you willing to risk 100 points? How about 200? \n\nTichu has long been the favorite card game of all time on BoardGameGeek. Find out why! I promise that you won't regret it! \n\nTichu boasts the following great features:\n\nFully licensed and authorized by designer Urs Hostettler and publisher Fata Morgana Spiele.\n\nComputer controlled opponents boast a challenging and lifelike Artificial Intelligence that is configurable in numerous ways.\n\nUp to 4 humans can play from any supported device in any part of the world.\n\nData automatically backed up to the cloud and synced to any device that runs the game!\n\nExtensive tutorial and in-game documentation will teach you how to play and have you playing like a champ in no time.\n\nHint feature helps you play while you learn.\n\nChoose from multiple beautiful deck styles.", "minimumOsVersion": "13", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3.88889, "sellerUrl": "http://housefullofgames.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "EL", "HU", "IT", "JA", "NB", "PT", "ZH", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes": "164301824", "formattedPrice": "￦7,700", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 81, "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 81}]}